@startuml Diagrama de Despliegue Local - AutoGestión SaaS

!define RECTANGLE class

title Diagrama de Despliegue Local - AutoGestión SaaS

node "Máquina de Desarrollo" as DEV {
    rectangle "Visual Studio / VS Code" as IDE
    rectangle "Terminal" as TERMINAL
    rectangle "Navegador Web" as BROWSER
}

node "Servidor Local (localhost)" as SERVER {
    rectangle "Frontend (Vite React)" as FRONTEND {
        rectangle "Servidor de Desarrollo" as VITE_DEV
        rectangle "Aplicación React" as REACT_APP
    }
    
    rectangle "Backend .NET" as BACKEND {
        rectangle "Administrador API" as ADMIN_API
        rectangle "Inventario API" as INV_API
        rectangle "Clientes API" as CLI_API
        rectangle "Ventas API" as VENTAS_API
    }
}

node "PostgreSQL Local" as PG_SERVER {
    rectangle "PostgreSQL 17" as PG {
        rectangle "autogestion_administrador" as DB_ADMIN
        rectangle "autogestion_inventario_1" as DB_INV_1
        rectangle "autogestion_clientes_1" as DB_CLI_1
        rectangle "autogestion_ventas_1" as DB_VENTAS_1
        rectangle "autogestion_inventario_2" as DB_INV_2
        rectangle "autogestion_clientes_2" as DB_CLI_2
        rectangle "autogestion_ventas_2" as DB_VENTAS_2
    }
    
    rectangle "pgAdmin 4" as PGADMIN
}

node "Herramientas" as TOOLS {
    rectangle "Git" as GIT
    rectangle "GitHub" as GITHUB
    rectangle "Swagger UI" as SWAGGER
}

IDE --> GIT : Commit
IDE --> GITHUB : Push/Pull
TERMINAL --> FRONTEND : npm run dev
TERMINAL --> BACKEND : dotnet run
BROWSER --> FRONTEND : http://localhost:5173
BROWSER --> SWAGGER : http://localhost:5100-5103/swagger

FRONTEND --> ADMIN_API : HTTP
FRONTEND --> INV_API : HTTP
FRONTEND --> CLI_API : HTTP
FRONTEND --> VENTAS_API : HTTP

ADMIN_API --> DB_ADMIN : EF Core
INV_API --> DB_INV_1 : EF Core
INV_API --> DB_INV_2 : EF Core
CLI_API --> DB_CLI_1 : EF Core
CLI_API --> DB_CLI_2 : EF Core
VENTAS_API --> DB_VENTAS_1 : EF Core
VENTAS_API --> DB_VENTAS_2 : EF Core

PGADMIN --> PG : Gestión

note right of FRONTEND
  Vite Development Server
  Puerto: 5173
  Hot Module Replacement
  React 19.3.1
end note

note right of ADMIN_API
  ASP.NET Core
  Puerto: 5100
  Swagger: /swagger
  Gestión de tenants
end note

note right of INV_API
  ASP.NET Core
  Puerto: 5101
  Swagger: /swagger
  Inventario vehículos
end note

note right of CLI_API
  ASP.NET Core
  Puerto: 5102
  Swagger: /swagger
  Gestión clientes
end note

note right of VENTAS_API
  ASP.NET Core
  Puerto: 5103
  Swagger: /swagger
  Gestión ventas
end note

note right of PG
  PostgreSQL 17
  Puerto: 5432
  Host: localhost
  Usuario: postgres
  Password: (configurada localmente)
end note

note right of PGADMIN
  pgAdmin 4
  Gestión visual de bases
  Verificación de tenants
  Consultas SQL
end note

note bottom
  Configuración de Ejecución:
  
  1. Crear base autogestion_administrador
  2. Ejecutar migración inicial
  3. Iniciar 4 terminales
  4. Ejecutar cada microservicio:
     - dotnet run --project AutoGestion.Administrador
     - dotnet run --project AutoGestion.Inventario
     - dotnet run --project AutoGestion.Clientes
     - dotnet run --project AutoGestion.Ventas
  5. Iniciar frontend: npm run dev
  6. Acceder a Swagger para pruebas
  7. Configurar X-Tenant-Id en Swagger
end note

note top
  Requisitos:
  - .NET SDK 8
  - Node.js (para Vite)
  - PostgreSQL 17 con CREATEDB
  - Visual Studio o VS Code
  - Puertos libres: 5173, 5100-5103, 5432
end note

@enduml
